$ where $X_i' \\to X_i$ is a $U$-admissible\nblowup, $X_i' \\to X$ is an open immersion, and $X$ is separated and finite\ntype over $S$."], "original_pass2_hypotheses_proposed": ["Let $S$ be a quasi-compact and quasi-separated scheme.\nLet $U \\to X_1$ and $U \\to X_2$ be open immersions\nof schemes over $S$ and assume $U$, $X_1$, $X_2$ of finite\ntype and separated over $S$."], "original_source_statement_tex": "\\label{lemma-find-common-blowups}\nLet $S$ be a quasi-compact and quasi-separated scheme.\nLet $U \\to X_1$ and $U \\to X_2$ be open immersions\nof schemes over $S$ and assume $U$, $X_1$, $X_2$ of finite\ntype and separated over $S$. Then there exists a commutative diagram\n$$\n\\xymatrix{\nX_1' \\ar[d] \\ar[r] & X & X_2' \\ar[l] \\ar[d] \\\\\nX_1 & U \\ar[l] \\ar[lu] \\ar[u] \\ar[ru] \\ar[r] & X_2\n}\n$$\nof schemes over $S$ where $X_i' \\to X_i$ is a $U$-admissible\nblowup, $X_i' \\to X$ is an open immersion, and $X$ is separated and finite\ntype over $S$.", "pass3_eligible": false, "published": false, "schema": "maththm.four-complete-chapters.standalone-editorial-draft.v1", "section_ambient_hypotheses_auto_inherited": [], "section_end_line": 10001, "section_index": 194, "section_key": "s194", "section_start_line": 9532, "section_title": "Nagata compactification", "source_enumerated_clauses": [], "source_filename": "flat.tex", "source_formal_environment": "lemma", "source_formal_environment_end_line": 9661, "source_formal_environment_start_line": 9646, "source_inline_reference_labels": [], "source_label": "lemma-find-common-blowups", "source_logical_form": "plain_source_statement", "source_named_reference_labels": [], "source_proof_screened": false, "source_revision": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_scoped_conventions_and_situations": [], "source_statement_line": 9646, "source_url": "https://github.com/stacks/stacks-project/blob/a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14/flat.tex#L9646", "standalone_statement_tex": "Let $S$ be a quasi-compact and quasi-separated scheme.\nLet $U \\to X_1$ and $U \\to X_2$ be open immersions\nof schemes over $S$ and assume $U$, $X_1$, $X_2$ of finite\ntype and separated over $S$. Then there exists a commutative diagram\n$$\n\\xymatrix{\nX_1' \\ar[d] \\ar[r] & X & X_2' \\ar[l] \\ar[d] \\\\\nX_1 & U \\ar[l] \\ar[lu] \\ar[u] \\ar[ru] \\ar[r] & X_2\n}\n$$\nof schemes over $S$ where $X_i' \\to X_i$ is a $U$-admissible\nblowup, $X_i' \\to X$ is an open immersion, and $X$ is separated and finite\ntype over $S$."}
