bscheme.\nLet $V \\to X \\times_S Y$ be a quasi-compact morphism\nwhose composition with the first projection maps into $U$.\nLet $Z \\subset X \\times_S Y$ be the scheme theoretic image of\n$V \\to X \\times_S Y$. Let $X' \\to X$ be a $U$-admissible blowup."], "original_source_statement_tex": "\\label{lemma-replaced-by-strict-transform}\nLet $X \\to S$ and $Y \\to S$ be morphisms of schemes.\nLet $U \\subset X$ be an open subscheme.\nLet $V \\to X \\times_S Y$ be a quasi-compact morphism\nwhose composition with the first projection maps into $U$.\nLet $Z \\subset X \\times_S Y$ be the scheme theoretic image of\n$V \\to X \\times_S Y$. Let $X' \\to X$ be a $U$-admissible blowup.\nThen the scheme theoretic image of $V \\to X' \\times_S Y$ is the\nstrict transform of $Z$ with respect to the blowing up.", "pass3_eligible": false, "published": false, "schema": "maththm.four-complete-chapters.standalone-editorial-draft.v1", "section_ambient_hypotheses_auto_inherited": [], "section_end_line": 10001, "section_index": 194, "section_key": "s194", "section_start_line": 9532, "section_title": "Nagata compactification", "source_enumerated_clauses": [], "source_filename": "flat.tex", "source_formal_environment": "lemma", "source_formal_environment_end_line": 9737, "source_formal_environment_start_line": 9727, "source_inline_reference_labels": [], "source_label": "lemma-replaced-by-strict-transform", "source_logical_form": "plain_source_statement", "source_named_reference_labels": [], "source_proof_screened": false, "source_revision": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_scoped_conventions_and_situations": [], "source_statement_line": 9727, "source_url": "https://github.com/stacks/stacks-project/blob/a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14/flat.tex#L9727", "standalone_statement_tex": "Let $X \\to S$ and $Y \\to S$ be morphisms of schemes.\nLet $U \\subset X$ be an open subscheme.\nLet $V \\to X \\times_S Y$ be a quasi-compact morphism\nwhose composition with the first projection maps into $U$.\nLet $Z \\subset X \\times_S Y$ be the scheme theoretic image of\n$V \\to X \\times_S Y$. Let $X' \\to X$ be a $U$-admissible blowup.\nThen the scheme theoretic image of $V \\to X' \\times_S Y$ is the\nstrict transform of $Z$ with respect to the blowing up."}
